title: "Fourier-Physics-Informed-NN: a band-resolved, budget-controlled benchmark of spectral vs local neural operators, with a physics-informed spectral-bias study"
abstract: "A controlled benchmark separating three Fourier constructs (spectral convolution, Fourier-feature encodings, classical correlation) and evaluating each against its local or classical counterpart at matched budget, plus a PINN spectral-bias demonstration and an explainer animation."
